          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "IMAGE\nThe Image node allows you to import an image into your patch. \nThe JPG, PNG and TIFF file formats are supported.\nThe image can be loaded in the node panel or by using the Image Resource inlet.\n\nBy default the image imported straight, this can be disabled in the node panel for when your images have premultiplied alpha."
